# Media engine — read the skill first

**Read `.ai/skills/media.md` before changing demux, frame index, Player, or WebCodecs code.**

For new features or bug fixes in this area, consult [mediabunny](https://github.com/Vanilagy/mediabunny) first, then adapt patterns in Rust (not a dependency).

- Primary position = presentation `FrameId`, not `time * fps`.
- Decode windows use **decode_order** (B-frames).
- Do not `flush()` between forward playback frames in the same GOP.
- `media/` must not import `app` / Leptos.
